<template><view :class="['app-page',{dark}]"><ui-header title="消息中心"/><view v-if="messages.length" class="message-tools"><text>{{unread}}条未读</text><text @tap="readAll">全部已读</text></view><view v-if="messages.length" class="message-list"><view v-for="item in messages" :key="item.id" :class="['message-card',{unread:!Number(item.isRead)}]" @tap="open(item)"><view class="message-icon"><ui-icon :name="item.type==='order'?'receipt-clock':'bell'" :size="42"/></view><view class="message-copy"><text class="message-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.content}}</text><text class="time">{{displayDateTime(item.createdAt)}}</text></view><view v-if="!Number(item.isRead)" class="dot"></view><ui-icon name="chevron-right" :size="28"/></view></view><ui-empty v-else title="暂无会话记录" description="订单与系统消息将在这里显示"/><ui-bottom-nav active="messages"/></view></template>
<script>import{isDark}from'@/utils/app';import{api}from'@/services/api';export default{data(){return{dark:false,messages:[]}},computed:{unread(){return this.messages.filter(i=>!Number(i.isRead)).length}},onShow(){this.dark=isDark();if(uni.getStorageSync('token'))api.getMessages().then(list=>{this.messages=list;uni.$emit('club-messages-changed')}).catch(()=>{})},methods:{async open(item){if(!Number(item.isRead)){await api.readMessage(item.id);item.isRead=1;uni.$emit('club-messages-changed')}const id=item.referenceId;if(item.referenceType==='order')uni.navigateTo({url:'/pages/order/detail?id='+id});else if(item.referenceType==='aftersale')uni.navigateTo({url:'/pages/aftersale/detail?id='+id});else if(item.referenceType==='recharge')uni.navigateTo({url:'/pages/wallet/recharge-detail?id='+id});else if(item.referenceType==='withdrawal')uni.navigateTo({url:'/pages/wallet/withdrawal-detail?id='+id});else if(item.referenceType==='identity')uni.navigateTo({url:'/pages/settings/identity'});else if(item.referenceType==='application')uni.navigateTo({url:'/pages/apply/index'})},async readAll(){await api.readAllMessages();this.messages.forEach(i=>{i.isRead=1});uni.$emit('club-messages-changed')}}}</script>
<style scoped>.message-tools{padding:18rpx 28rpx 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:22rpx}.message-tools text:last-child{color:var(--primary)}.message-list{padding:20rpx 24rpx}.message-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20rpx;margin-bottom:16rpx;padding:24rpx;border:1rpx solid rgba(24,35,58,.03);border-radius:22rpx;background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)}.message-card.unread{border-color:rgba(240,68,90,.18)}.message-icon{width:84rpx;height:84rpx;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:26rpx;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--primary-soft)}.message-copy{min-width:0;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7rpx}.message-title{font-weight:700}.message-copy .muted{font-size:23rpx;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.time{color:var(--muted);font-size:20rpx}.dot{width:14rpx;height:14rpx;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary)}</style>
